===== F maps 可检出性（按新文档口径核对）=====
--- 文档现状（t17 说已由文档任务改好）---
20:- ⚠️ 明确记录重放机制的三条代价：① 显式配置 egress 的进程会保留**常驻模块代码页**（重放线程与 PLT hook 都在 `.so` 里）——但**按名字扫 `/proc/<pid>/maps` 看不到**（Zygisk 用无名/匿名映射，实测 armed 进程 3170 行命中 0），真判断要比匿名可执行段；② 应用运行中修改设备级代理不落在 0–2000ms 重放窗口内，需重启应用；③ `setpriority` hook 未命中时退化为一次性注入（`replay hook unavailable`），注入值可能被框架覆盖
72:- 🔒 属性区改用进程私有副本，消除 maps 中的 rw-p 指纹
20:- ⚠️ The three costs of the replay mechanism are documented: (1) a process with explicit egress keeps the **module code pages resident** (the replay thread and the PLT hook live in the `.so`) — but they are **not visible by name in `/proc/<pid>/maps`** (Zygisk uses unnamed/anonymous mappings; an armed process showed 0 hits across 3170 lines), so detection must compare anonymous executable segments; (2) changing the device-wide proxy while an app is running falls outside the 0–2000ms replay window, so the app must restart; (3) when the `setpriority` hook cannot be installed the injection degrades to one-shot (`replay hook unavailable`) and may be overwritten by the framework
72:- 🔒 Property areas now use process-private copies, eliminating rw-p fingerprint in maps

